Task from your leader (you are subagent a2, scenario demo):

Run the demo scenario: do a short demonstration task and report a brief summary of what you did.

When you are done, call the send_to_leader tool exactly once:
- status: "ok" when the task is done, "error" when you could not do it
- summary: the outcome in a few sentences; it is what the leader reads first
- detail: optional structured result; when given it must match this JSON Schema (demo/v1):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "projectName",
    "filesRead"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "projectName": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Name of the project"
    },
    "filesRead": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "description": "Paths of the files you read"
    }
  }
}
```

You cannot ask the leader questions: decide yourself and state your assumptions in the summary.
